{"repo": "Aider-AI/aider", "pull_number": 703, "instance_id": "Aider-AI__aider-703", "issue_numbers": ["700"], "base_commit": "0a95badf3f0f8819064b06f5320d17fc5190f557", "patch": "diff --git a/aider/models.py b/aider/models.py\n--- a/aider/models.py\n+++ b/aider/models.py\n@@ -196,6 +196,20 @@ class ModelSettings:\n         weak_model_name=\"openrouter/anthropic/claude-3-haiku-20240307\",\n         use_repo_map=True,\n     ),\n+    # Vertex AI Claude models\n+    ModelSettings(\n+        \"vertex_ai/claude-3-5-sonnet@20240620\",\n+        \"diff\",\n+        weak_model_name=\"vertex_ai/claude-3-haiku@20240307\",\n+        use_repo_map=True,\n+    ),\n+    ModelSettings(\n+        \"vertex_ai/claude-3-opus@20240229\",\n+        \"diff\",\n+        weak_model_name=\"vertex_ai/claude-3-haiku@20240307\",\n+        use_repo_map=True,\n+        send_undo_reply=True,\n+    ),\n     # Cohere\n     ModelSettings(\n         \"command-r-plus\",\n", "test_patch": "", "problem_statement": "vertex_ai/claude_* models aren't in MODEL_SETTINGS\n### Issue\n\nWhen using e.g. `vertex_ai/claude-3-5-sonnet@20240620`, `aider` falls back to whole-file editing with no repo map.\r\n\r\nIt seems that the `MODEL_SETTINGS` const in [aider/models.py](https://github.com/paul-gauthier/aider/blob/main/aider/models.py#L35) will never match Vertex AI's Claude because the provider/**model** match expects `claude-3-5-sonnet-2024062` (hyphen before build identifier) rather than `claude-3-5-sonnet@2024062` (at-sign before build identifier)\n\n### Version and model info\n\n> Aider v0.39.0  \r\n> Model: vertex_ai/claude-3-5-sonnet@20240620 with whole edit format  \r\n> Git repo: .git with 23 files  \r\n> Repo-map: disabled  \n", "hints_text": "Adding the models directly to the const *mostly* works, but throws errors because `litellm` doesn't have token costs for the weak model `vertex_ai/claude-3-haiku@20240307`\r\n\r\noddly, litellm also says that system messages aren't supported in the same error, which isn't correct.\r\n\r\nIt's far too late for me to be writing a pair of coordinating PRs now, but I'll try and do that tomorrow. \ud83d\ude04 \nThanks for trying aider and filing this issue. I'd be happy to see a PR that adds the vertex versions to MODEL_SETTINGS.", "created_at": "2024-06-21T16:31:17Z"}
{"repo": "Aider-AI/aider", "pull_number": 1239, "instance_id": "Aider-AI__aider-1239", "issue_numbers": ["1222"], "base_commit": "301c4265b76a5b8c4a939acb59314e091cacebec", "patch": "diff --git a/aider/coders/editblock_coder.py b/aider/coders/editblock_coder.py\n--- a/aider/coders/editblock_coder.py\n+++ b/aider/coders/editblock_coder.py\n@@ -442,7 +442,14 @@ def find_original_update_blocks(content, fence=DEFAULT_FENCE, valid_fnames=None)\n         # Check for SEARCH/REPLACE blocks\n         if line.strip() == HEAD:\n             try:\n-                filename = find_filename(lines[max(0, i - 3) : i], fence, valid_fnames)\n+                # if next line after HEAD exists and is DIVIDER, it's a new file\n+                if i + 1 < len(lines) and lines[i + 1].strip() == DIVIDER:\n+                    filename = find_filename(lines[max(0, i - 3) : i], fence, None)\n+                else:\n+                    filename = find_filename(\n+                        lines[max(0, i - 3) : i], fence, valid_fnames\n+                    )\n+\n                 if not filename:\n                     if current_filename:\n                         filename = current_filename\n", "test_patch": "diff --git a/tests/basic/test_editblock.py b/tests/basic/test_editblock.py\n--- a/tests/basic/test_editblock.py\n+++ b/tests/basic/test_editblock.py\n@@ -456,6 +456,43 @@ def test_deepseek_coder_v2_filename_mangling(self):\n             ],\n         )\n \n+    def test_new_file_created_in_same_folder(self):\n+        edit = \"\"\"\n+Here's the change:\n+\n+path/to/a/file2.txt\n+```python\n+<<<<<<< SEARCH\n+=======\n+three\n+>>>>>>> REPLACE\n+```\n+\n+another change\n+\n+path/to/a/file1.txt\n+```python\n+<<<<<<< SEARCH\n+one\n+=======\n+two\n+>>>>>>> REPLACE\n+```\n+\n+Hope you like it!\n+\"\"\"\n+\n+        edits = list(\n+            eb.find_original_update_blocks(edit, valid_fnames=[\"path/to/a/file1.txt\"])\n+        )\n+        self.assertEqual(\n+            edits,\n+            [\n+                (\"path/to/a/file2.txt\", \"\", \"three\\n\"),\n+                (\"path/to/a/file1.txt\", \"one\\n\", \"two\\n\"),\n+            ],\n+        )\n+\n \n if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n     unittest.main()\n", "problem_statement": "Files are not being created\n### Issue\n\nafter 0.53 I started to experience following problem. If during refactoring aider decides to create a file or if I explicitly ask it to create a file, it generates `SEARCH/REPLACE`  for new file, but then doesn't try to create a new file:\r\n\r\n```\r\n> /code i asked to move bucket config to a separate file\r\n\r\nI apologize for the oversight. You're right, we need to move the bucket configuration to a\r\nseparate file. Let's make that change now.\r\n\r\nFirst, let's create a new file for the bucket configuration:\r\n\r\nterraform/renovate/bucket.tf\r\n\r\n <<<<<<<SEARCH\r\n =======\r\n resource \"aws_s3_bucket\" \"renovate-terraform\" {\r\n \r\n // omitted output\r\n \r\n Tokens: 6.8k sent, 812 received. Cost: $0.03 message, $0.07 session.\r\nApplied edit to terraform/renovate/role.tf\r\nNo changes made to git tracked files.\r\nNo changes made to git tracked files.\r\n```\n\n### Version and model info\n\nAider v0.54.4\r\nMain model: claude-3-5-sonnet-20240620 with diff edit format, infinite output\r\nWeak model: claude-3-haiku-20240307\r\nGit repo: ../../.git with 250 files\r\nRepo-map: using 1024 tokens, auto refresh\r\nAdded terraform/renovate/role.tf to the chat.\r\n\n", "hints_text": "Thanks for trying aider and filing this issue.\r\n\r\nCan you share more of that response? Including all the actual <<SEARCH/====/<<<REPLACE lines and a few lines before and after them. For all files that were in that response from Sonnet.\r\n\r\nIt's hard for me to tell what's happening from the snippet you shared.\nHey Paul! I'm facing the same issue now. Logs from the console:\r\n```\r\npipx run aider-chat --model openrouter/anthropic/claude-3.5-sonnet \r\nNOTE: running app 'aider' from 'aider-chat'\r\n\r\nAider v0.54.6\r\nMain model: openrouter/anthropic/claude-3.5-sonnet with diff edit format, infinite output\r\nWeak model: openrouter/anthropic/claude-3-haiku-20240307\r\nGit repo: .git with 1,001 files\r\nWarning: For large repos, consider using --subtree-only and .aiderignore\r\nSee: https://aider.chat/docs/faq.html#can-i-use-aider-in-a-large-mono-repo\r\nRepo-map: using 1024 tokens, auto refresh\r\nUse /help <question> for help, run \"aider --help\" to see cmd line args\r\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\r\n> /add app/Telegram/BotKeyboard.php                                                                                                                                                                                                     \r\n\r\nAdded /home/kazrez/projects/ddteam/bot/app/Telegram/BotKeyboard.php to the chat\r\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\r\napp/Telegram/BotKeyboard.php                                                                                                                                                                                                            \r\n> /add app/Enums/Telegram/TelegramAction.php                                                                                                                 